    "description": "AST fixture for the terrain-following (hybrid, mass-form + 3-D dp reconstruction) upwind-biased monotone PPM flux-form vertical advection rule. Supplies a genuinely 3-D pressure-at-edges pe[i,j,kn] and derives the rank-3 thickness dp via lev_thickness_3d; the wind W is a matched operand.",
    "license": "MIT"
  },
